{"id":339,"name":"barboach","speciesId":339,"dex":339,"form":"normal","generation":3,"types":["water","ground"],"stats":{"hp":50,"attack":48,"defense":43,"special-attack":46,"special-defense":41,"speed":60},"abilities":[{"name":"oblivious","hidden":false},{"name":"anticipation","hidden":false},{"name":"hydration","hidden":true}],"height":4,"weight":19,"baseExp":58,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/339.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/339.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/339.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/339.ogg","genus":"Whiskers Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"BARBOACH’s sensitive whiskers serve as a superb radar system. This POKéMON hides in mud, leaving only its two whiskers exposed while it waits for prey to come along."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"BARBOACH’s body is covered with a slimy film. If a foe grabs it, this POKéMON just slips out of the enemy’s grip. This POKéMON grows weak if the slimy coating dries up."},{"version":"emerald","text":"Its body is covered with a slimy film. The film acts as a barrier to prevent germs in muddy water from entering the BARBOACH’s body."},{"version":"firered","text":"It probes muddy riverbeds with its two long whiskers. A slimy film protects its body."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It coats its entire body with a slimy fluid so it can squirm and slip away if grabbed."},{"version":"pearl","text":"Its whiskers make a superb radar. They are used to locate prey, even in the murkiest of water."},{"version":"platinum","text":"Its slimy body is hard to grasp. In one region, it is said to have been born from hardened mud."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"BARBOACH uses its whiskers to taste things just as a person uses his or her tongue to taste 